  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To 30A Oasis!<br>King / King / 2 Twins / Full Over Full Bunks / Sleeper<br>Pool/Hot Tub May Be Heated For $50/Day<br><br>From her vantage point well above the tree line, Pinkie Flamingo had a spectacular “bird's eye view” of the entire lay of the land. Stretching her wings luxuriously, she floated over clusters of opulent vacation homes…each standing ready to welcome those fortuitous enough to have discovered the undeniable charm of Florida's scenic highway 30A. It was another glorious sunny day along the Emerald Coast of Florida and all was right with the world.<br><br>As Pinkie drifted along her favorite route, she spied what appeared to be a mirage glimmering in the heat of the summer sun. A spectacular 3-story private home with an enormous sparkling resort-style pool seemed to beckon her. Landing gently on the roof, Pinkie surveyed the layout below. The inviting house sat just off County Hwy 393 which ran through the popular community of Gulf Place. The privacy fence created the backdrop for a very cozy backyard oasis graced by the most deliciously-inviting pool. The scene stood ready to host the perfect soiree and Pinkie could envision cook-outs or happy hours in the courtyard filled with friends and family. Intrigued, Pinkie swooped down for further investigation.<br><br> Not your run of the mill beach vacation rental, 30A Oasis sports a style all its own with coastal furnishings arranged to create a special space that will soon become your new vacation go-to. The high ceilings grant a spacious unhurried feeling while the palette of neutral colors set the stage for a relaxing vacation. With three floors in which to spread out, your group of 12 will have the option of privacy or togetherness throughout their stay.<br><br>Let's Look Inside!<br><br>Level 1<br>Spacious Open Living/Dining/Entertainment Area<br>Queen Sleeper Sofa<br>Fully-Stocked Gourmet Kitchen<br>Dining Table with Seating For 6<br>Counter with 4 Bar Stools<br><br>Level 2<br>King Master Suite <br>Bunk Room with Full Over Full Bunks<br>Laundry Area<br><br>Level 3<br>King Master Suite with Private Balcony<br>Guest Bedroom with 2 Twin Beds<br><br>Outdoors<br>“Sea Shed” Filled with Beach Gear<br>Propane Grill<br>Resort Pool <br>Outdoor Shower<br>Outdoor Dining Table Seats 6<br><br>Makin My Way Along 30A…Gulf Place<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>•\tMust Be 25 To Book<br>•\tNo Smoking <br>•\tCancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>•\tSheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>•\tAll Kitchens Fully-Equipped with Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>•\tBasic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
